    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CONTINGENCY": "Contingency",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CONTINGENCY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Two promotions for mages (Channeling II); a mage holds one of them at a time, and loses it when it fires:[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Contingency: Strike. When its plot is attacked, the mage casts its damage spell (else the magic bolt) before the battle's first round.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Contingency: Recall. When a hit would kill the mage in a battle, it leaves the battle and returns to its capital with 1 HP.",
